unting or Receipt Accounting. Transactions created after the pending close date, even if they relate to a current or prior period, won't be processed.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"calculation\\\": \\\"2025-09-30T20:25:00 minus 2025-09-30T18:00:00 = 8700 seconds = 145 minutes\\\"\\n}\"}",
